translate es strings:

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:6
    old "Some days you just do not feel up to it. You sleep away the rest of the day."
    new "Algunos días simplemente no tienes ganas. Duermes el resto del día."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:6
    old "You come up with an excuse for yourself and sleep through the rest of the day."
    new "Te inventas una excusa y duermes el resto del día."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:6
    old "You convince yourself you are too exhausted for any more human interaction."
    new "Te convences de que estás demasiado agotado para cualquier interacción humana."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:6
    old "You stare at the ceiling for ten minutes and decide that is enough effort for today."
    new "Te quedas mirando el techo por diez minutos y decides que ya fue suficiente esfuerzo por hoy."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:6
    old "You set three alarms. You turn them all off. You go back to sleep."
    new "Pones tres alarmas. Las apagas todas. Vuelves a dormir."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:6
    old "Your bed has a gravitational pull today. There is nothing you can do about it."
    new "Tu cama tiene una fuerza gravitacional hoy. No hay nada que puedas hacer."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:6
    old "Technically, sleeping is also a skill. You are just practicing."
    new "Técnicamente, dormir también es una habilidad. Solo estás practicando."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:6
    old "Achievement unlocked: Horizontal Champion."
    new "Logro desbloqueado: Campeón Horizontal."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:17
    old "Are you looking for a specific event or what?"
    new "¿Estás buscando algún evento específico o qué?"

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:17
    old "You know the point of the game is the girls, right?"
    new "Sabes que el objetivo del juego son las chicas, ¿no?"

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:17
    old "Hey buddy, try some new interactions. Get out of bed. I believe in you."
    new "Oye amigo, intenta unas interacciones nuevas. Sal de la cama. Creo en ti."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:17
    old "Your pillow is not a character. It does not have a story arc."
    new "Tu almohada no es un personaje. No tiene arco narrativo."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:17
    old "The world outside your room is still there. Probably."
    new "El mundo afuera de tu cuarto todavía está ahí. Probablemente."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:33
    old "You listen to the teacher's lecture. He rounds pi to 5 and gravity to 10."
    new "Asistes a la clase del profesor. Redondea pi a 5 y la gravedad a 10."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:33
    old "The teacher spends the entire class arguing with a student about whether dinosaurs had feathers. Time flies."
    new "El profesor pasa toda la clase discutiendo con un alumno si los dinosaurios tenían plumas. El tiempo vuela."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:33
    old "The teacher spends most of the class talking about her personal life. It was actually a fun lesson."
    new "La profesora pasa la mayor parte de la clase hablando de su vida personal. En realidad fue una clase divertida."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:33
    old "You learn about the history of silent Austrian cinema. Interesting."
    new "Aprendes sobre la historia del cine mudo austríaco. Interesante."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:33
    old "The professor draws a diagram on the board. By the end of class, nobody, including him, knows what it represents."
    new "El profesor dibuja un diagrama en el pizarrón. Al final de la clase, nadie, incluido él, sabe qué representa."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:33
    old "Today's topic is quantum mechanics. The teacher explains it using a cat. You leave more confused than before."
    new "El tema de hoy es mecánica cuántica. El profesor lo explica usando un gato. Sales más confundido que antes."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:33
    old "The class is split into groups for a project. You end up doing everything alone anyway. Productive."
    new "La clase se divide en grupos para un proyecto. Terminas haciéndolo todo solo de todos modos. Productivo."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:33
    old "The teacher loses his train of thought mid-sentence and just says 'anyway, moving on'. Three times."
    new "El profesor pierde el hilo a mitad de frase y solo dice 'en fin, continuemos'. Tres veces."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:33
    old "You read the textbook while the professor reads the exact same textbook out loud. Efficient."
    new "Lees el libro mientras el profesor lee el mismo libro en voz alta. Eficiente."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:33
    old "A student asks a question. The teacher responds with 'great question' and then answers a completely different question."
    new "Un alumno hace una pregunta. El profesor responde con 'excelente pregunta' y después responde una pregunta completamente diferente."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:33
    old "The projector breaks. The teacher improvises by describing the slides out loud for forty minutes."
    new "El proyector se descompone. El profesor improvisa describiendo las diapositivas en voz alta por cuarenta minutos."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:33
    old "Extra credit is offered for whoever can explain the concept back. Nobody volunteers. Silence. Class dismissed."
    new "Punto extra para quien logre explicar el concepto de vuelta. Nadie se ofrece. Silencio. Clase terminada."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:33
    old "The substitute teacher is clearly more lost than the students. A student ends up teaching the class."
    new "El profesor sustituto está claramente más perdido que los alumnos. Un alumno termina dando la clase."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:33
    old "You take notes diligently. Later you realize the notes say nothing useful, but your handwriting has never looked better."
    new "Tomas notas con dedicación. Después te das cuenta de que no anotaste nada útil, pero tu caligrafía nunca se vio tan bonita."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:58
    old "Alright, today is leg day... First exercise squat, second scott curl, third straight curl... wtf, who put this routine together?"
    new "Bueno, hoy es día de pierna... Primer ejercicio sentadilla, segundo curl scott, tercero curl directo... ¿qué demonios, quién armó esta rutina?"

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:58
    old "You down your crazy clown pre-workout . It gives you energy and you manage to bench press 2kg on each side."
    new "Tomas tu pre-entreno payaso loco. Te da energía y logras hacer press de banca con 2kg de cada lado."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:58
    old "You arrive at the gym, grab the heaviest dumbbell... it is 4kg. You put it back and grab the 2kg ones."
    new "Llegas al gimnasio, agarras la mancuerna más pesada... es de 4kg. La devuelves y agarras las de 2kg."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:58
    old "Thirty minutes on the treadmill. You feel like a champion."
    new "Treinta minutos en la caminadora. Te sientes un campeón."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:58
    old "You try to do a pull-up. You hang there for a while. You come back down. That counts as a rep."
    new "Intentas hacer una dominada. Te quedas colgado un rato. Bajas. Eso cuenta como una repetición."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:58
    old "The gym is packed. You spend most of the time waiting for equipment and scrolling your phone. Still counts."
    new "El gimnasio está lleno. Pasas la mayor parte del tiempo esperando aparatos y revisando el celular. Aun así cuenta."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:58
    old "You put on your most intimidating face in the mirror while doing curls. Someone walks in. You pretend to check your form."
    new "Pones tu cara más intimidante en el espejo mientras haces curl. Alguien entra. Finges estar revisando tu forma."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:58
    old "Today is chest day. You do three sets, feel incredible, and then remember you skipped chest last week too."
    new "Hoy es día de pecho. Haces tres series, te sientes increíble, y después recuerdas que te saltaste pecho la semana pasada también."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:58
    old "You spot someone with perfect form and study them carefully. You try to copy it. You hurt your back doing bicep curls."
    new "Ves a alguien con forma perfecta y lo estudias atentamente. Intentas copiarlo. Te lastimas la espalda haciendo curl de bíceps."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:58
    old "You finish your session, drenched in sweat."
    new "Terminas tu entrenamiento, empapado de sudor."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:58
    old "You go full beast mode for the first set. The second set humbles you. The third set simply does not happen."
    new "Vas en modo bestia total en la primera serie. La segunda serie te humilla. La tercera simplemente no sucede."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:58
    old "You take a selfie for motivation. You look exhausted. You post it anyway."
    new "Te tomas una selfie para motivación. Te ves agotado. La publicas de todos modos."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:58
    old "The protein shake you brought smells suspicious. You drink it anyway. Gains are gains."
    new "El batido de proteína que trajiste tiene un olor sospechoso. Lo bebes de todos modos. Ganancia es ganancia."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:58
    old "Leg press, hip thrust, leg curl. You leave walking like a penguin. Mission accomplished."
    new "Leg press, hip thrust, curl de pierna. Sales caminando como pingüino. Misión cumplida."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:58
    old "You dedicate today to abs. Forty crunches in, you decide abs are overrated anyway."
    new "Dedicas el día al abdomen. Cuarenta abdominales después, decides que el abdomen está sobrevalorado."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:130
    old "Maybe later, I'm just relaxing."
    new "Tal vez después, solo estoy relajándome."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:130
    old "Not right now, thanks."
    new "Ahora no, gracias."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:130
    old "I'm good just sunbathing for now."
    new "Estoy bien solo tomando sol por ahora."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:151
    old "Time to get in."
    new "Hora de entrar."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:153
    old "Cannonball"
    new "Bomba de agua"

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:178
    old "Normal dive"
    new "Clavado normal"

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:193
    old "Use the ladder"
    new "Usar la escalera"

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:222
    old "It's nice, come on in. {i}(Truth){/i}"
    new "Está rica, entra. {i}(Verdad){/i}"

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:236
    old "It's super warm, like a bath. {i}(Lie){/i}"
    new "Está super calientita, como una tina. {i}(Mentira){/i}"

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:377
    old "You walk into the shower and see [_ag.Name]. She freezes for a second, eyes locked on you."
    new "Entras a la ducha y ves a [_ag.Name]. Se congela por un segundo, con los ojos fijos en ti."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:377
    old "You step into the shower. [_ag.Name] is there, water running down her body. She notices you."
    new "Entras a la ducha. [_ag.Name] esta ahi, agua corriendo por su cuerpo. Te nota."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:377
    old "[_ag.Name] is in the shower. For a brief moment, her eyes wander over you before she catches herself."
    new "[_ag.Name] está en la ducha. Por un breve momento, sus ojos te recorren antes de contenerse."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:383
    old "She hesitates, her gaze lingering just a moment too long... then her expression hardens."
    new "Ella duda, la mirada demorándose un momento de más... entonces su expresión se endurece."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:383
    old "For a split second, something flickers in her eyes... but then she remembers she's furious."
    new "Por una fracción de segundo, algo brilla en sus ojos... pero entonces recuerda que está furiosa."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:383
    old "Her lips part slightly... but then she clenches her jaw and looks away."
    new "Sus labios se entreabren... pero entonces aprieta la mandíbula y desvía la mirada."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:389
    old "No. I'm still mad at you. Don't even look at me."
    new "No. Todavía estoy enojada contigo. Ni me mires."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:389
    old "Don't think seeing me like this changes anything. I'm STILL angry."
    new "No pienses que verme así cambia algo. TODAVÍA estoy enojada."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:389
    old "I was here first. But I'd rather leave than share this space with you right now."
    new "Yo llegué primero. Pero prefiero irme a compartir este espacio contigo ahora."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:389
    old "You have some nerve showing up here. I'm leaving."
    new "Tienes mucho descaro de aparecer aquí. Me voy."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:414
    old "Keep dreaming."
    new "Sigue soñando."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:414
    old "Hygiene is a very personal moment."
    new "La higiene es un momento muy personal."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:414
    old "I don't think so..."
    new "Creo que no..."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:414
    old "Maybe another time."
    new "Tal vez en otro momento."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:414
    old "You wish."
    new "Quisieras."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:414
    old "Not happening."
    new "Ni pensarlo."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:423
    old "Sure... why not?"
    new "¿Claro... por qué no?"

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:423
    old "Alright, but no funny business."
    new "Está bien, pero sin chistecitos."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:423
    old "Fine, but don't stare too much."
    new "Bien, pero no te quedes mirando mucho."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:423
    old "I guess there's room for two."
    new "Creo que cabemos dos."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:431
    old "Fine, get in. But if you peek too much, I'm splashing you."
    new "Bien, entra. Pero si te quedas espiando mucho, te echo agua."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:431
    old "You want to shower together? Bold. Get in before I change my mind."
    new "¿Quieres bañarte juntos? Atrevido. Entra antes de que cambie de opinión."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:431
    old "Alright, but keep your hands where I can see them... or don't."
    new "Está bien, pero mantén las manos donde pueda verlas... o no."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:431
    old "O-okay... but don't look while you get in!"
    new "B-bien... ¡pero no mires mientras entras!"

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:431
    old "We can share, but... no funny business, okay?"
    new "Podemos compartir, pero... sin chistecitos, ¿ok?"

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:431
    old "Promise you won't look too much? ...Fine, come in."
    new "¿Prometes que no te vas a quedar mirando mucho? ...Bien, entra."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:431
    old "Sure, why not? It's just a shower... right?"
    new "¿Claro, por qué no? Es solo un baño... ¿no?"

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:431
    old "This is innocent enough. Just two people sharing hot water."
    new "Esto es lo bastante inocente. Solo dos personas compartiendo agua caliente."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:431
    old "A shower together? You don't have to ask me twice."
    new "¿Un baño juntos? No tienes que pedirlo dos veces."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:431
    old "My %(pl)s would lose it if %(pp)s knew. Get in."
    new "Mi %(pl)s enloquecería si supiera. Entra."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:431
    old "A shower? Together?! I... okay, but don't stare!"
    new "¿Un baño? ¿¡Juntos?! Yo... bien, ¡pero no te quedes mirando!"

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:431
    old "I've never done this before... just... be normal about it."
    new "Nunca hice esto antes... solo... actúa normal."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:431
    old "This is so embarrassing... fine, but eyes up!"
    new "Esto es tan vergonzoso... bien, ¡pero ojos arriba!"

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:431
    old "What if someone walks in?! Lock the door first!"
    new "¡¿Y si alguien entra?! ¡Cierra la puerta primero!"

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:431
    old "Are you sure no one will see us? Okay... hurry up."
    new "¿Estás seguro de que nadie va a ver? Bien... apúrate."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:431
    old "Close the curtain properly! I don't want anyone seeing!"
    new "¡Cierra la cortina bien! ¡No quiero que nadie vea!"

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:431
    old "Leave the door unlocked. Makes it more exciting."
    new "Deja la puerta sin cerrar. Se pone más emocionante."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:431
    old "A shower together? I was hoping you'd ask."
    new "¿Un baño juntos? Esperaba que lo pidieras."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:431
    old "Sure. And I don't care who knows about it."
    new "Claro. Y no me importa quién lo sepa."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:431
    old "Fine, but this means nothing. I'm just saving water."
    new "Bien, pero esto no significa nada. Solo estoy ahorrando agua."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:431
    old "Just a shower, nothing more. Don't get any ideas."
    new "Solo un baño, nada más. No te hagas ideas."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:431
    old "Okay, but keep your distance. This doesn't mean anything."
    new "Bien, pero mantén distancia. Esto no significa nada."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:431
    old "Just a shower, nothing more. I have a %(pl)s."
    new "Solo un baño, nada más. Tengo un %(pl)s."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:431
    old "My %(pl)s wouldn't like this... but it's just a shower."
    new "A mi %(pl)s no le gustaría esto... pero es solo un baño."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:481
    old "We already messed up behind closed doors. We can't do this here, someone could see us."
    new "Ya hicimos cosas a puertas cerradas. No podemos hacer esto aquí, alguien puede vernos."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:481
    old "What we did in the room was risky enough. I'm not adding a public shower to the list."
    new "Lo que hicimos en el cuarto ya fue demasiado arriesgado. No voy a agregar ducha pública a la lista."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:481
    old "Are you crazy? What if someone walks in? At least in the room we had a locked door."
    new "¿Estás loco? ¿Y si alguien entra? Al menos en el cuarto la puerta estaba cerrada."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:481
    old "No. What happens in private stays in private. This is way too exposed."
    new "No. Lo que pasa en privado se queda en privado. Aquí es muy expuesto."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:481
    old "I'm not repeating what we did where anyone could catch us. Not here."
    new "No voy a repetir lo que hicimos donde cualquiera pueda pillarnos. Aquí no."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:481
    old "Keep what we do between us. In a shower? Someone will definitely find out."
    new "Mantén lo nuestro entre nosotros. ¿En la ducha? Alguien seguro se va a enterar."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:491
    old "Not now. I shower alone when I'm in a mood."
    new "Ahora no. Me baño sola cuando estoy de mal humor."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:491
    old "Get out. I don't share my shower time."
    new "Sal. No comparto mi tiempo de baño."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:491
    old "N-no! That's way too embarrassing!"
    new "¡N-no! ¡Eso es demasiado vergonzoso!"

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:491
    old "I can't shower with you watching me! Go away!"
    new "¡No puedo bañarme contigo mirándome! ¡Vete!"

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:491
    old "Not right now. Even I need my privacy sometimes."
    new "Ahora no. Hasta yo necesito privacidad a veces."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:491
    old "Maybe another time. I'm in a rush."
    new "Tal vez en otro momento. Tengo prisa."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:491
    old "No way! I'm not ready for that!"
    new "¡De ninguna manera! ¡No estoy lista para eso!"

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:491
    old "Absolutely not! That's too much too fast!"
    new "¡De ninguna manera! ¡Eso es demasiado, muy rápido!"

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:491
    old "No! What if someone hears us?!"
    new "¡No! ¡¿Y si alguien nos escucha?!"

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:491
    old "Are you crazy?! Someone could walk in!"
    new "¡¿Estás loco?! ¡Alguien puede entrar!"

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:491
    old "No. This crosses a line."
    new "No. Eso pasa los límites."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:491
    old "Absolutely not. I barely know you like that."
    new "De ninguna manera. Apenas te conozco para eso."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:491
    old "No. I have a %(pl)s and this crosses a line."
    new "No. Tengo un %(pl)s y eso pasa los límites."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:491
    old "Absolutely not. I'm taken."
    new "De ninguna manera. Estoy comprometida."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:730
    old "Sorry, I forgot my towel... I didn't think you'd already be naked."
    new "Perdón, olvidé mi toalla... No pensé que ya estarías desnudo."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:730
    old "I left my shampoo, I just need to... oh. You're already undressed."
    new "Olvidé mi shampoo, solo necesito... ah. Ya estás sin ropa."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:730
    old "Ugh, I forgot my stuff. Don't look at me like that, I'm just grabbing my things."
    new "Ugh, olvidé mis cosas. No me mires así, solo estoy agarrando mis cosas."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:730
    old "I swear I'm not coming back because I changed my mind. I just forgot my conditioner. ...Why are you naked already?"
    new "Juro que no volví porque cambié de opinión. Solo olvidé mi acondicionador. ...¿Por qué ya estás desnudo?"

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:787
    old "Well... since I'm already here again, I might as well stay."
    new "Bueno... ya que estoy aquí de nuevo, mejor me quedo."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:787
    old "Fine, fine. I'll just... stay this time. Don't make it weird."
    new "Bien, bien. Voy a... quedarme esta vez. No lo hagas raro."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:787
    old "Okay, okay. You win. Move over."
    new "Bien, bien. Ganaste. Hazte a un lado."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:799
    old "Anyway, I got what I needed. Bye."
    new "En fin, agarré lo que necesitaba. Adiós."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:810
    old "Well... since I'm already here."
    new "Bueno... ya que estoy aquí."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:810
    old "Don't mind if I do."
    new "Si no te importa, me quedo."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:810
    old "Looks like there's room for two."
    new "Parece que caben dos aquí."

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:822
    old "S-sorry! I didn't know anyone was in here!"
    new "¡P-perdón! ¡No sabía que había alguien aquí!"

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:822
    old "Oh! I... I'll come back later!"
    new "¡Ah! Yo... ¡vuelvo después!"

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:822
    old "Excuse me! I'm so sorry!"
    new "Con permiso! Perdon!"

    # game/scripts/Actions/actions.rpy:822
    old "I didn't see anything! ...much."
    new "¡No vi nada! ...casi."

